{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "_comment": "Default behaviour rules (schema v2, architecture/VBOOK_BEHAVIOUR.md): global, EN, gestures only — no appearance or clothes (never conflicts with passport / render_rules). Phrases are subject-less verb phrases: the storyboard prepends the character_id. Effective rules of a book = these defaults overridden by behavior.json rules with the same id; enabled:false in the book disables a default. Sample character rules: behaviour-rules.example.json (not loaded). defaults.max_per_scene: at most N behaviours per scene (0 = off); a book overrides it with behavior.json defaults.max_per_scene.",
  "defaults": {
    "max_per_scene": 2
  },
  "rules": [
